device R5 2 R 50.0
device R7 1 R 50.0
voltagesource VG1 1
voltagenoisesource VN1 2
device F1 2 gaussianrisetimefilter 18.2e-12 rt_type 1090
device F2 2 ffe -0.1,0.8,-0.1 td 18.868e-12 pre 1
device O1 1 open
voltagenoisesource VN2 2
connect VN1 2 R5 1
voltageoutput Unequalized R5 2
connect R5 2 VN2 2 F2 1
connect R7 1 VN2 1
connect F1 1 VG1 1
connect VN1 1 F1 2
eyeprobe Equalized F2 2
connect F2 2 O1 1
